guide forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/swift-galestrider
title Swift Galestrider
category Collectibles
folder Mounts · Level 60
keywords Swift Empyrean Galestrider, Swift Stormy Galestrider, Swift Umber Galestrider, Swift Regal Galestrider, Skyborne, Genn Fairweather, Zephras Isle, Valanaar, Riding
collects 269671, 269678, 274933
levels 60-60
zone map 2521

# Galestriders, the Skyborne racial mounts, from Genn Fairweather in Valanaar on
# Zephras Isle.
# Genn Fairweather sells them for 200 gold; skyboats leave the isle.
# Sources: NPC 265756 (position; "Stablemaster and Riding Trainer"); Forever's
# world data: his vendor rows (build 70338) and trainer (build 70124: Apprentice
# Riding 100g at 40, Journeyman Riding 1,000g at 60); Forever client 1.60.1.70532
# via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level 60, every race; MountCapability: Riding 150
# and Galestrider Riding 1285849; SkillLineAbility: the Skyborne get Galestrider
# Riding with Riding, the other races must learn it). Regal Galestrider and Swift
# Regal Galestrider have no known source. A beta player guide: the Skyborne buy
# their riding and mount from Genn, and other races' mounts need Exalted.
# INGAME: how does a non-Skyborne learn Galestrider Riding (Genn at Exalted with
# the High Order or the Windshapers, as other races' riding was in Classic?).

step Journeyman Riding
  only Human,Dwarf,NightElf,Gnome,Orc,Troll,Tauren,Undead
  tip Swift Galestriders need level 60 and Journeyman Riding. Train it at your own race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides for where.
  level 60
  skill Riding 150

step Skyboat from Dalaran
  only Alliance
  when !zone "Zephras Isle"
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes (another flies from north of Thunder Bluff; either faction may take either). Skip this if you are already on the island.
  goto 12.5,51.8 "Skyboat to Zephras Isle" live

step Skyboat from Thunder Bluff
  only Horde
  when !zone "Zephras Isle"
  zone Mulgore
  tip Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes (another flies from Dalaran; either faction may take either). Skip this if you are already on the island.
  goto 34.3,25.8 "Skyboat to Zephras Isle" live

step Journeyman Riding with Genn Fairweather
  only Skyborne
  zone map 2521
  tip Skyborne train Journeyman Riding with Genn Fairweather himself for 1,000g; Blizzard says it comes with a mount. He stands at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar, near the skyboat docks.
  level 60
  train 265756                        -- Genn Fairweather, riding trainer
  skill Riding 150

step Galestrider Riding for other races
  only Human,Dwarf,NightElf,Gnome,Orc,Troll,Tauren,Undead
  when !knows 1285849
  zone map 2521
  tip Any race can buy Galestriders, but riding one also takes Galestrider Riding, which only the Skyborne get with Riding. Other races can learn it too, but how is not known yet: in Classic another race's riding needed Exalted with its home faction, here the High Order (Alliance) or the Windshapers (Horde). Ask Genn Fairweather before you buy.
  talk 265756                         -- Genn Fairweather

step Genn Fairweather
  zone map 2521
  tip Genn Fairweather is at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar, the island's harbour town, near the skyboat docks. The Forever client lists each Swift Galestrider at 200g; choose one.
  vendor 265756 "Genn Fairweather" @53.8,81.2
  buy 269671 "Swift Empyrean Galestrider" npc 265756 optional -- 200g
  buy 269678 "Swift Stormy Galestrider" npc 265756 optional -- 200g
  buy 274933 "Swift Umber Galestrider" npc 265756 optional -- 200g
